Problem: Best Time to Buy and Sell Stock (Single vs Infinite Transactions)
Single Transaction Algorithm: int maxProfit(vector<int>& prices) { int minPrice = INT_MAX, maxP = 0; for(int p : prices) { minPrice = min(minPrice, p); maxP = max(maxP, p - minPrice); } return maxP; }
Infinite Transactions: Sum all positive slopes prices[i] - prices[i-1]. Complexity: O(n) time, O(1) space.
